 "what": "CHALLENGE-AI-COOLING-06 (decision CHALLENGE-AI-COOLING-L0-06): chip-cold-plate v1.0 gains its first construction contract, Level 0 only. The only rebuildable family is the existing public Gaussian kernel-ridge reconstruction (kernel_ridge); its length and ridge are choices from the published calibration grid only (defaults length_8 and ridge_1e_6), fitted in closed form at float64 from the digest-pinned public 400-record TRAIN artifact on the existing pinned CPU isolated carrier, with no GPU lane. A cold-plate neural operator and learned optimizer are not implemented; pretrained weights, loss expressions and reference-solver or counted-CFD reuse are excluded. DEVELOPMENT only: official evaluation stays fail closed (cooling_validator_not_served), and the attack budget and fresh confirmation population remain human input."
